 hn5yldk h1ygp1zx h1swkjl2 h17jdcla h1b3p96f har3wvv hltxh0p" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/a64ccfd335c07945e243e47c35c7bb19ac627ef4-687x922.jpg?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=280&amp;q=80&amp;w=190 190w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/a64ccfd335c07945e243e47c35c7bb19ac627ef4-687x922.jpg?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=560&amp;q=80&amp;w=380 380w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/a64ccfd335c07945e243e47c35c7bb19ac627ef4-687x922.jpg?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=840&amp;q=80&amp;w=570 570w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/a64ccfd335c07945e243e47c35c7bb19ac627ef4-687x922.jpg?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=922&amp;q=80&amp;w=626 626w" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/a64ccfd335c07945e243e47c35c7bb19ac627ef4-687x922.jpg?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=560&amp;q=80&amp;w=380" width="380" height="560"/><div class="h1hmmtxd hvgmmoa h10r54k4 lourrnp hediiz5 hd338mg lxz1fvz l11nfusl l3tpop0 h1b5cp2d h1a2seni hn5yldk l2tle6 h1gflh3k hkyl10o h1ygp1zx"><div class="l3kfh9j h1hslxfe h1lygp9o h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6dca hlo4w61 h1ijw7co hkxk3sm hmn4qbn hddcdtd h1ph8y73 h1tx6ijs h1di44is h51ynae h1qke1w hzlyjbb">02</div><h1 class="h1hslxfe heuq102 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6dd7 hlo4w61 hlnf8nw h1x1fs5d h1vipym hdww5a5 h1tx6ijs h1di44is h51ynae h14f7q8p hzlyjbb">High Demand on the Grid </h1><p class="h1hslxfe h19tm6v4 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hsekc3f h1pijrpm hkxfefo h1xbm56k h13649ij">Demand for electricity is increasing at an unprecedented pace, with AI and data centers consuming a growing percentage of the global power supply, and the electrification of consumer products requiring more electricity produced per individual than ever before.</p></div><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="short-term" class="h10eqbqm h6kohwp hd338mg hn5yldk h1ygp1zx h1swkjl2 h17jdcla h1b3p96f har3wvv hltxh0p" width="380" height="560" style="aspect-ratio:380 / 560" data-lqip="true"/><img data-loading="true" alt="" style="height:10px;width:10px;position:absolute;z-index:-10;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;user-select:none" loading="lazy" class="h10eqbqm h6kohwp hd338mg hn5yldk h1ygp1zx h1swkjl2 h17jdcla h1b3p96f har3wvv hltxh0p" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/9bc8062644b4522ee70e7c8642d763dec7739324-6240x4160.jpg?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=280&amp;q=80&amp;w=190 190w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/9bc8062644b4522ee70e7c8642d763dec7739324-6240x4160.jpg?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=560&amp;q=80&amp;w=380 380w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/9bc8062644b4522ee70e7c8642d763dec7739324-6240x4160.jpg?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=840&amp;q=80&amp;w=570 570w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/9bc8062644b4522ee70e7c8642d763dec7739324-6240x4160.jpg?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=1120&amp;q=80&amp;w=760 760w" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/9bc8062644b4522ee70e7c8642d763dec7739324-6240x4160.jpg?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=560&amp;q=80&amp;w=380" width="380" height="560"/><div class="h1hmmtxd hvgmmoa h10r54k4 lourrnp hediiz5 hd338mg lxz1fvz l11nfusl l3tpop0 h1b5cp2d h1a2seni hn5yldk l2tle6 h1gflh3k hkyl10o h1ygp1zx"><div class="l3kfh9j h1hslxfe h1lygp9o h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6dca hlo4w61 h1ijw7co hkxk3sm hmn4qbn hddcdtd h1ph8y73 h1tx6ijs h1di44is h51ynae h1qke1w hzlyjbb">03</div><h1 class="h1hslxfe heuq102 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6dd7 hlo4w61 hlnf8nw h1x1fs5d h1vipym hdww5a5 h1tx6ijs h1di44is h51ynae h14f7q8p hzlyjbb">Short-Term Price Exposure </h1><p class="h1hslxfe h19tm6v4 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hsekc3f h1pijrpm hkxfefo h1xbm56k h13649ij">The cost of electricity now spikes wildly in times of high demand, and power users in renewable-friendly locations such as Texas and California are severely impacted in these scenarios. Unusually hot days see prices jump exponentially as available supply is choked.</p></div></div></div><script>$RC("B:2","S:2")</script><div hidden id="S:3"><div class="h1hmmtxd l3ggwp2 loim0bx h1o2gjf2 hcz045n hb9iiu0 h1oex22d h1ex33ab h189zf4k h969e84 h2lwdd7 h1u8plpz h15va3o3"><h1 class="h1hslxfe h1dlovtk h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6f0c hlo4w61 h1hmmtxd loim0bx h7vdw5j h10eqbqm l1b4vqn9 l11rffb5 hdmdqat l4rvbrs h1n257pi l11rffcz h1cnewgy htrkre1 h1vkrgzd h1st8bmc hs5lfpo hxis673 h46919l h1eqhhq1"><div class="h5fsh1b">Precision </div><div class="h5fsh1b">Trading for</div><div class="h5fsh1b">Power Volatility</div></h1><h1 class="h1hms5mz htdyhe2 h9z66pb h1hslxfe h1dlovtk h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6f0c hlo4w61 h1hmmtxd loim0bx h7vdw5j h10eqbqm l1b4vqn9 l11rffb5 hdmdqat l4rvbrs h1n257pi l11rffcz h1cnewgy htrkre1 h1vkrgzd h1st8bmc hs5lfpo hxis673 h46919l h1eqhhq1"><div class="h5fsh1b">Precision </div><div class="h5fsh1b">Trading for</div><div class="h5fsh1b">Power Volatility</div></h1><div class="h1hmmtxd l1s0nvfs hpgjlqp h143mfed loim0bx hvyddtl lco2fn6 hkbjmfz hvhcfxf ljn52jz hsbwj7l hcmqwvd l1wmz1gt haa9130 h9npra5 l1928rf hy8maz0 hz7ltz1 h1m4ihbz lt6b5fy"><h2 class="h1hslxfe h1nro4z0 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hsekc3a hlo4w61 h1hk6xg6 h1o5vkkg h1qy52eu hxtjp0p hf5b9qk hovt6mo">Trade | Hedge | Monetize</h2><div class="h1hslxfe h19tm6v4 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6j7l h141iukv h1hk6xg6 h1pijrpm h1tb92t5 hkxfefo h179d5eg h1xbm56k h1ylwxll h13649ij h1lu8hcc"><p>ElectronX offers <span class="h1044r2y">small-sized, short-duration products,</span> including bounded futures and binary options for hourly periods, on a platform structured <span class="h1044r2y">to manage electricity price risk against short-term volatility.</span></p><p><span class="h1c7b2g8 hk3pmkn"></span></p></div></div></div></div><script>$RC("B:3","S:3")</script><div hidden id="S:4"><div class="l1vaf6wd h1ps2v9q hn3vp5i hv3qtap h175laiu h1nc4kdv hgd8enh hh0cpuw h71yz8t l1x61cbw h1c8ulel h1pqhck7 l1x3tcza h1yui6vl h1u4r9xg l14kj9aw h155x5dg h8rn9sf lglit23 hflrvb6 h39q0hg l12ykg8c h1w7w6jp"><div class="h1hmmtxd h3fjssa loim0bx l1t1eogv hvz4853 ha8egj5 h10eqbqm l1d844g9 h486fdt ltcsnbq hwpsp85 lb7nty3 h1hagtp4 l5qkufn lxgqzls h8lhzt2 h1eqhhq1 l11jb98t"><div class="h1hmmtxd l1s0q6mj lso059x lfkd99q l16lt240 lmowsw5"><div class="h141i2um lblt3up h1nz9u9k h57kdvw hvxk82g h1ef1960 hbb9vlh h1nusp9w hkyl10o"><h2 class="h1hslxfe heuq102 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6dd7 hlo4w61 lowh3ey hlnf8nw h1x1fs5d h1vipym hdww5a5">Highly accessible market for all users</h2><p class="text-797655ea3185 h1hslxfe h19tm6v4 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6dgv lowh3ey hgtv4cu h1pijrpm hkxfefo h1xbm56k h13649ij h6ofrdn hrzeg5s">Participate without brokers or high capital requirements, and trade via our web-based trading application, third-party trading applications, or API</p></div><div class="h141i2um lblt3up h1nz9u9k h57kdvw hvxk82g h1ef1960 hbb9vlh h1nusp9w hkyl10o"><h2 class="h1hslxfe heuq102 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6dd7 hlo4w61 lowh3ey hlnf8nw h1x1fs5d h1vipym hdww5a5">Granular contracts to fit intraday volatility</h2><p class="text-79008d8fd5c1 h1hslxfe h19tm6v4 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6dgv lowh3ey hgtv4cu h1pijrpm hkxfefo h1xbm56k h13649ij h6ofrdn hrzeg5s">Sized in single megawatt-hours over hourly periods across many locations</p></div><div class="h141i2um lblt3up h1nz9u9k h57kdvw hvxk82g h1ef1960 hbb9vlh h1nusp9w hkyl10o"><h2 class="h1hslxfe heuq102 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6dd7 hlo4w61 lowh3ey hlnf8nw h1x1fs5d h1vipym hdww5a5">Deep liquidity via diverse participant base</h2><p class="text-774285e78022 h1hslxfe h19tm6v4 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6dgv lowh3ey hgtv4cu h1pijrpm hkxfefo h1xbm56k h13649ij h6ofrdn hrzeg5s">Trade with the full scope of market participants, regardless of balance sheet size</p></div><div class="h141i2um lblt3up h1nz9u9k h57kdvw hvxk82g h1ef1960 hbb9vlh h1nusp9w hkyl10o"><h2 class="h1hslxfe heuq102 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6dd7 hlo4w61 lowh3ey hlnf8nw h1x1fs5d h1vipym hdww5a5">Virtually no counterparty risk with centrally-cleared market</h2><p class="text-08fbf2e89e57 h1hslxfe h19tm6v4 h1n7r37a h1h7fgjc hdy6dgv lowh3ey hgtv4cu h1pijrpm hkxfefo h1xbm56k h13649ij h6ofrdn hrzeg5s">Seamless near real-time settlement with fully collateralized contracts</p></div></div><div class="h1hmmtxd h1wm1kg3"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="a blue square with white lines around it on a black background" class="image-797655ea3185 h1ytqdt2 l1bf78ev h10eqbqm h1c0i1o0 h15e380g h1m6reb4 h1u70nzt h1ygp1zx h1swkjl2 h17jdcla h1b3p96f har3wvv h1ndcahp" width="500" height="500" style="aspect-ratio:500 / 500" data-lqip="true"/><img data-loading="true" alt="" style="height:10px;width:10px;position:absolute;z-index:-10;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;user-select:none" loading="lazy" class="image-797655ea3185 h1ytqdt2 l1bf78ev h10eqbqm h1c0i1o0 h15e380g h1m6reb4 h1u70nzt h1ygp1zx h1swkjl2 h17jdcla h1b3p96f har3wvv h1ndcahp" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/26ac27ef6fd729d0c94773b0eb128d8da58af162-2511x2472.png?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=250&amp;q=80&amp;w=250 250w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/26ac27ef6fd729d0c94773b0eb128d8da58af162-2511x2472.png?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=500&amp;q=80&amp;w=500 500w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/26ac27ef6fd729d0c94773b0eb128d8da58af162-2511x2472.png?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=750&amp;q=80&amp;w=750 750w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/26ac27ef6fd729d0c94773b0eb128d8da58af162-2511x2472.png?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=1000&amp;q=80&amp;w=1000 1000w" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bpyvas7v/production/26ac27ef6fd729d0c94773b0eb128d8da58af162-2511x2472.png?auto=format&amp;crop=entropy&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=500&amp;q=80&amp;w=500" width="500" height="500"/><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="a blue and white square with a black background" class="image-79008d8fd5c1 h1ytqdt2 l1bf78ev h10eqbqm h1c0i1o0 h15e380g h1m6reb4